license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/spodlesny2318-arch/Cranebench"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmarking framework for underactuated crane control. It
  fixes the plants, disturbance models, paired uncertainty design, metric
  module and provenance ledger, and supplies five classical baselines and no
  novel controller, so that a new controller can be evaluated against a bench
  independent of its own implementation.
keywords:
  - crane control
  - underactuated systems
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
  - Monte Carlo
  - paired experimental design
